(6629515, 989992, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love this! Those expressions are perfect with that title, it made me chuckle. The lovely old books really set the scene with the very antique-y looking dolls, nice sharp focus too. Very good job.</td>', 'I love this! Those expressions are perfect with that title, it made me chuckle. The lovely old books really set the scene with the very antique-y looking dolls, nice sharp focus too. Very good job.', '2011-12-31 22:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6629516, 989506, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and focus, groovy little characters, nice scene. I would have cropped it a little further out though so as not to cut off the bottom of the closest horse and the top of the background lance.</td>', 'Nice colours and focus, groovy little characters, nice scene. I would have cropped it a little further out though so as not to cut off the bottom of the closest horse and the top of the background lance.', '2011-12-31 22:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6629518, 990153, 94265, '<td valign="top">The title obviously works with the gangsta medallion, quite amusing. Nice range of colours, sharp focus. Contrast is a teeny bit dark for me, I''d have liked more detail on the eyes of the main toy.</td>', 'The title obviously works with the gangsta medallion, quite amusing. Nice range of colours, sharp focus. Contrast is a teeny bit dark for me, I''d have liked more detail on the eyes of the main toy.', '2011-12-31 22:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6629520, 989625, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is quite amusing, I like the idea, it could have been quite cool but the editing really puts me off. Looks like a selective blur which is really patchy, particularly noticeable on the left of the baby buggy. It unfortunately ruins the shot for me.</td>', 'This is quite amusing, I like the idea, it could have been quite cool but the editing really puts me off. Looks like a selective blur which is really patchy, particularly noticeable on the left of the baby buggy. It unfortunately ruins the shot for me.', '2011-12-31 22:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6629532, 990181, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the two frames of the cars speeding and the final ''crash'' frame. I wish the image was a bit bigger though, it could maybe have done with a thinner border, the border is a bit too eye-catching from the subject. The shadow at the bottom of the first two frames is also a bit distracting. Marks for the idea and set-up (cool little road) but execution is kinda lacking.</td>', 'I like the idea of the two frames of the cars speeding and the final ''crash'' frame. I wish the image was a bit bigger though, it could maybe have done with a thinner border, the border is a bit too eye-catching from the subject. The shadow at the bottom of the first two frames is also a bit distracting. Marks for the idea and set-up (cool little road) but execution is kinda lacking.', '2011-12-31 22:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6629721, 990082, 126903, '<td valign="top">i really like the way you have processed this and it tells a story, however I find it distracting to see the kitchen table and chairs in the image.</td>', 'i really like the way you have processed this and it tells a story, however I find it distracting to see the kitchen table and chairs in the image.', '2012-01-01 05:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
