(6636758, 989907, 136309, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Giles_uk:</b></div><hr/><i> haha i like it, seen a few of this characters adventures on flickr, like the detail in the grid and the expansion grooves in the concrete. back lighting of the eyes is cool and makes them shine. Are you unasia on Flickr just seen a full set of there''s of danbos adventures? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>nope thats not me, I think they are very popular, I have posted a couple on there but they are very easy to work with...the 2010 art doll!</td>', 'Originally posted by Giles_uk: haha i like it, seen a few of this characters adventures on flickr, like the detail in the grid and the expansion grooves in the concrete. back lighting of the eyes is cool and makes them shine. Are you unasia on Flickr just seen a full set of there''s of danbos adventures?   nope thats not me, I think they are very popular, I have posted a couple on there but they are very easy to work with...the 2010 art doll!', '2012-01-06 12:03:43.000000', NULL, 0),
