(6636785, 989992, 43410, '<td valign="top">this is amazing :) Well done!  i''m laughing so hard right now</td>', 'this is amazing :) Well done!  i''m laughing so hard right now', '2012-01-06 12:39:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6636797, 990082, 137576, '<td valign="top">they are scale model toys to a very accurate 1:16 scale hence their details, <br/> <br/>theres no tilt shift effect i can see? the affect of the 16-35mm lens? <br/> <br/>no experience with this on construction site was meant to be road works on the road, hence the tape, if a 6th photo would have been allowed there was a que of traffic inc the low loader with a forklift on and a bin truck the idea being the  land rover got impatient and over took the traffic but crashed into the roadworks. <br/> <br/>my boy has the models of everything we have in our family construction firm apart from the crane which we hire in, and the fire engines of course. <br/> <br/>i had men in it origianlly but removed them<br/> <br/>original idea<br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/cyberprop/6595256697/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm8.staticflickr.com/7033/6595256697_28fc45aa81.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm8.staticflickr.com/7033/6595256697_28fc45aa81.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm8.staticflickr.com/7033/6595256697_28fc45aa81.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/cyberprop/6595256697/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">dpc_toys_Comic</a> by <a href="//www.flickr.com/people/cyberprop/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">gilesbert</a>, on Flickr<br/> <br/>cartoon effect in topaz and unrefined layout<br/> <br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/cyberprop/6595258503/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm8.staticflickr.com/7029/6595258503_b0de7ea6e7.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm8.staticflickr.com/7029/6595258503_b0de7ea6e7.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm8.staticflickr.com/7029/6595258503_b0de7ea6e7.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/cyberprop/6595258503/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">dpc_toys_square</a> by <a href="//www.flickr.com/people/cyberprop/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">gilesbert</a>, on Flickr<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-01 06:21:50.</i></td>', 'they are scale model toys to a very accurate 1:16 scale hence their details,  theres no tilt shift effect i can see? the affect of the 16-35mm lens?  no experience with this on construction site was meant to be road works on the road, hence the tape, if a 6th photo would have been allowed there was a que of traffic inc the low loader with a forklift on and a bin truck the idea being the  land rover got impatient and over took the traffic but crashed into the roadworks.  my boy has the models of everything we have in our family construction firm apart from the crane which we hire in, and the fire engines of course.  i had men in it origianlly but removed them original idea dpc_toys_Comic by gilesbert, on Flickr cartoon effect in topaz and unrefined layout  dpc_toys_square by gilesbert, on Flickr', '2012-01-06 12:57:17.000000', '2012-03-01 06:21:50.000000', 0),
