(6636832, 990082, 12611, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Giles_uk:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by blindjustice:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the blue ribbon. I guess you have put the question as to whether the DPC voters don''t know what they are doing (and simply vote on an uneducated whim) to bed for good. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>touche :) hehe </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Just kidding around- but a serious congrats!</td>', 'Originally posted by Giles_uk: Originally posted by blindjustice: Congrats on the blue ribbon. I guess you have put the question as to whether the DPC voters don''t know what they are doing (and simply vote on an uneducated whim) to bed for good.   touche :) hehe   Just kidding around- but a serious congrats!', '2012-01-06 14:05:35.000000', NULL, 0),
